    "Authored": "OfficeIMO-authored pixels/text, MIT. c44 progressive/colour/gray IW44; cpaldjvu palettes; cjb2 symbols; djvused text/outline/rotation; djvumake JPEG and constructed MMR; minidjvu shared bundled and indirect JB2. PPM/PBM references decoded by ddjvu. JB2 work-limit inputs use OfficeIMO-authored record sequences with native ZP encoding; DjVuLibre independently decodes their geometry and selected empty pixels.",
